            <div xml:id="d71">

                <pb facs="0194" n="162" sameAs="frus:frus1961-63v12/pg162"/>

                <head>71. Memorandum From the Assistant Secretary of State for Inter-American
                    Affairs (Martin) to Secretary of State Rusk<anchor n="1" xml:id="d71-f1"
                    /></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1963-11-27">November 27,
                        1963</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Important Problems in Latin America</item>
                </list>
                <p>Attached are brief outlines of the following important problems faced by the
                    Bureau of Inter-American Affairs: <list>
                        <label>1.</label>
                        <item>Inter-American Committee for the Alliance for Progress.</item>
                        <label>2.</label>
                        <item>Foreign Ministers Meeting of the OAS.</item>
                        <label>3.</label>
                        <item>Principal Problems of U.S. Private Investment.</item>
                        <label>4.</label>
                        <item>Brazil.</item>
                        <label>5.</label>
                        <item>Recognition of Dominican Republic and Honduras.</item>
                        <label>6.</label>
                        <item>Cuba <list>
                                <label>a)</label>
                                <item>Arms cache in Venezuela</item>
                                <label>b)</label>
                                <item>NSAM 220 (shipping).</item>
                            </list></item>
                        <label>7.</label>
                        <item>Venezuela—Elections and Violence.</item>
                        <label>8.</label>
                        <item>Panama—Treaty Problems.</item>
                    </list></p>





                <xi:include href="d71-a1.xml" xpointer="d71-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d71-a2.xml" xpointer="d71-a2"/>
                <xi:include href="d71-a3.xml" xpointer="d71-a3"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
